      en: ["Built for the 1950 World Cup", "Record attendance of approximately 199,854 in 1950", "Official name: Estádio Jornalista Mário Filho", "Hosted the 1950 and 2014 World Cup finals", "Current capacity: 78,838 seats", "Site of the 2016 Olympic Games opening ceremony"],
