      en: "The São Paulo Museum of Art, or MASP, is one of the most important art museums in Latin America. Its suspended red structure on Avenida Paulista is as famous as its collection.",
      es: "El Museo de Arte de São Paulo (MASP) es uno de los museos más importantes de América Latina. El edificio en la Avenida Paulista se eleva sobre cuatro distintivas columnas rojas de hormigón.",
