      ro: ["Cu 72 de metri, este cel mai mare monument din ora\\\\u0219.", "Este alc\\\\u0103tuit din marmur\\\\u0103 pur\\\\u0103 de travertin.", "Serve\\\\u0219te \\\\u0219i ca mausoleu."],
